   "id": 510750,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Convert 329 into base 8.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Divide the number by 8.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"329 \\div 8 = 41\"></span> with a remainder. What is it?</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"41 \\times 8 = 328\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"329-328 = 1\"></span></p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>The remainder is 1.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"41{\\rm{R}}1\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step 2: Divide the quotient by 8.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"41 \\div 8 = 5\"></span> with a remainder. What is it?</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"8 \\times 5 = 40\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"41-40 = 1\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>The remainder is 1.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"5{\\rm{R}}1\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Step 3: Divide the quotient by 8.</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"5 \\div 8 = 0\"></span> with remainder 5.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"0{\\rm{R}}5\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The base 8 number has digits equal to the remainders in reverse order: <span data-math=\"{511_8}\"></span>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "511<sub>8</sub>"
    }
   ],
